1
00:00:13,513 --> 00:00:16,266
What's wrong with these eggs?

2
00:00:17,225 --> 00:00:18,560
A Stand…

3
00:00:18,643 --> 00:00:23,857
Pale Snake is no longer my Stand ability.

4
00:00:24,691 --> 00:00:27,736
Something else is inside me… but what?

5
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:30,071
I feel terrible…

6
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:34,075
Something is running loose inside me.

7
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:37,704
This power, it's beyond my control.

8
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:40,707
But this power carries hope.

9
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:44,419
I can at least feel
hope within this power.

10
00:00:44,502 --> 00:00:47,672
Dio's memo inside Jotaro's memory…

11
00:00:48,715 --> 00:00:52,010
It seems this power needs
the things in that memory.

12
00:00:52,093 --> 00:00:53,845
Time and place.

13
00:00:53,928 --> 00:00:56,347
North latitude, 28 degrees 24 minutes.

14
00:00:56,431 --> 00:00:58,767
West longitude, 80 degrees 36 minutes.

15
00:00:59,642 --> 00:01:02,896
That's where heaven will be.

16
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:06,900
This location is Cape Canaveral.

17
00:01:06,983 --> 00:01:08,902
Kennedy Space Center.

18
00:01:11,738 --> 00:01:16,034
In the beginning of all matter,
there was gravity.

19
00:01:16,117 --> 00:01:17,494
Even for this earth,

20
00:01:17,577 --> 00:01:19,746
gravity was its beginning.

21
00:01:19,829 --> 00:01:21,581
What's going on?

22
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:25,210
At this rate, we're going to fall!

23
00:01:25,293 --> 00:01:28,797
We aren't falling down, but sideways!

24
00:01:29,547 --> 00:01:32,008
Is this the priest's ability?

25
00:01:34,677 --> 00:01:38,181
Jolyne! Don't let go of Emporio!

26
00:01:38,765 --> 00:01:39,974
Diver Drive!

27
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:48,149
Ermes!

28
00:01:49,818 --> 00:01:54,114
Gravity keeps the planets revolving.

29
00:01:54,197 --> 00:01:57,659
Where shall I head on this earth now?

30
00:01:57,742 --> 00:01:59,577
What is going to transpire?

31
00:02:00,411 --> 00:02:03,748
This is the power my father sealed
in Egypt 20 years ago.

32
00:02:03,832 --> 00:02:08,545
This is what the priest called "heaven"!

33
00:02:08,628 --> 00:02:12,090
To my body and mind…

34
00:02:12,674 --> 00:02:15,135
and to the end of all things?

35
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:18,388
That's the entrance to the Visitor Center…

36
00:02:18,471 --> 00:02:21,432
Jolyne, the priest is still here, right?

37
00:02:22,016 --> 00:02:25,270
Yes, he's close. He's almost within reach.

38
00:02:28,606 --> 00:02:31,860
It's as if he was just here.

39
00:02:36,281 --> 00:02:39,576
The priest's Stand evolved!

40
00:04:13,461 --> 00:04:15,713
My right hand!

41
00:04:15,797 --> 00:04:16,631
EPISODE 34: SEE MOON (1)

42
00:04:16,714 --> 00:04:18,633
I came to finish you off now,

43
00:04:18,716 --> 00:04:20,927
if you can't wait two days.

44
00:04:21,511 --> 00:04:24,847
Jolyne Cujoh!

45
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:29,102
My arm is turning inside out!

46
00:04:29,185 --> 00:04:31,479
- Jolyne!
- Jolyne!

47
00:04:33,690 --> 00:04:36,526
So you are the one who's been
helping Jolyne this whole time.

48
00:04:38,653 --> 00:04:41,322
Emporio, get behind Anastasia!

49
00:04:42,865 --> 00:04:44,826
Stone Ocean!

50
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:53,167
Jolyne, behind you!

51
00:05:02,176 --> 00:05:06,306
I'll get rid of Jolyne Cujoh first.

52
00:05:06,889 --> 00:05:09,100
Anastasia, get over here. Hurry!

53
00:05:19,569 --> 00:05:21,446
What is this Stand?

54
00:05:21,529 --> 00:05:24,324
Your strands turned inside out!

55
00:05:24,407 --> 00:05:25,783
It turned my spike inside out too!

56
00:05:29,203 --> 00:05:32,665
That's where his fist touched,

57
00:05:32,749 --> 00:05:34,375
but it was merely a scratch!

58
00:05:34,459 --> 00:05:37,670
We have to stay away from his attacks!

59
00:05:38,254 --> 00:05:41,215
It must be gravity.
Think of the events leading up to now!

60
00:05:41,299 --> 00:05:43,634
The stand ability must be
related to gravity!

61
00:05:44,677 --> 00:05:48,222
All matters including the Earth and apples
are affected by gravity.

62
00:05:48,306 --> 00:05:52,226
Gravity attracts matter
towards the center of mass!

63
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:54,145
That's the cosmic law!

64
00:05:54,645 --> 00:05:59,317
This Stand ability alters gravity
and changes its direction!

65
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:04,113
Anything that touches its fist
turns inside out.

66
00:06:04,197 --> 00:06:08,951
I don't know its range,
but it makes everything fall sideways!

67
00:06:09,035 --> 00:06:12,789
So that's how the weak gravity
at Cape Canaveral

68
00:06:12,872 --> 00:06:15,208
affected and evolved the priest's Stand!

69
00:06:16,125 --> 00:06:19,796
Its powers are completely different
from Pale Snake's memory manipulation,

70
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:24,634
nor is it The Green Baby's power
of infinite division.

71
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:28,221
Jolyne, it's coming to strike again!

72
00:06:28,304 --> 00:06:31,015
Go to Anastasia, Emporio!

73
00:06:44,237 --> 00:06:45,321
It took a hit!

74
00:06:48,074 --> 00:06:50,076
Impossible!

75
00:06:54,163 --> 00:06:55,540
My leg is inverting!

76
00:06:55,623 --> 00:06:56,707
Jolyne!

77
00:07:00,086 --> 00:07:02,130
This can't be!

78
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:08,052
Don't panic, Emporio.

79
00:07:08,553 --> 00:07:10,471
You can relax.

80
00:07:10,972 --> 00:07:13,683
If everything it touches turns inside out,

81
00:07:13,766 --> 00:07:18,062
then I'll let it hit me again
to revert my body back right side out.

82
00:07:19,105 --> 00:07:21,274
Turn my body inside out…

83
00:07:21,357 --> 00:07:23,234
and outwards again!

84
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,616
Jolyne!

85
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:32,493
Good grief.

86
00:07:32,577 --> 00:07:33,744
Of course,

87
00:07:34,328 --> 00:07:37,748
I have to stitch the wounds.

88
00:07:38,749 --> 00:07:41,419
One thing is for certain now.

89
00:07:41,502 --> 00:07:45,381
Every strike I deal leaves damage!

90
00:07:45,965 --> 00:07:49,844
If I have to strike it down
here and now, then…

91
00:07:55,808 --> 00:07:57,393
We have no time to waste.

92
00:07:57,477 --> 00:07:59,604
Climb, Emporio.

93
00:07:59,687 --> 00:08:01,606
Get to the guardrails.

94
00:08:01,689 --> 00:08:06,444
I'm here as Jolyne's backup,
not your babysitter!

95
00:08:06,527 --> 00:08:07,695
I'm going!

96
00:08:34,347 --> 00:08:35,473
Jolyne!

97
00:08:35,556 --> 00:08:38,434
I already turned

98
00:08:39,644 --> 00:08:41,729
this ticketing box office inside out!

99
00:08:55,117 --> 00:08:57,453
The way it moves…

100
00:08:58,037 --> 00:09:01,541
Judging by the powers,
I thought it was an auto-tracking Stand,

101
00:09:02,041 --> 00:09:04,043
but the attacks are too accurate!

102
00:09:04,627 --> 00:09:06,170
As if it knows that it's useless,

103
00:09:06,254 --> 00:09:09,257
so it's no longer targeting
my arms and legs.

104
00:09:09,757 --> 00:09:14,762
It's now aiming for my vitals
like my head and chest,

105
00:09:14,845 --> 00:09:16,514
the only places that would be fatal!

106
00:09:17,348 --> 00:09:22,186
It dodged my kicks
with machine-like precision!

107
00:09:22,979 --> 00:09:25,898
This Stand is a remote control type!

108
00:09:28,609 --> 00:09:31,696
The priest's eyes are watching.

109
00:09:32,196 --> 00:09:36,409
This Stand's attacks are precise
because the priest can see the fight!

110
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:38,744
Its attacks only seem destructive

111
00:09:38,828 --> 00:09:42,790
because its power
is amplified by gravity. 

112
00:09:42,873 --> 00:09:49,005
Where is he?
I assumed he was hiding, but he's close!

113
00:09:49,505 --> 00:09:52,425
He is close enough from here
to see us clearly!

114
00:09:52,508 --> 00:09:54,677
Diver Drive!

115
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:56,012
Stay down.

116
00:09:59,098 --> 00:10:00,099
Anastasia!

117
00:10:00,975 --> 00:10:05,354
I said, I'll get rid of Jolyne first.

118
00:10:06,522 --> 00:10:08,190
Anastasia, Jolyne!

119
00:10:08,274 --> 00:10:10,776
Stone Ocean!

120
00:10:19,493 --> 00:10:20,411
Jolyne!

121
00:10:20,494 --> 00:10:22,788
What did you do, Jolyne?

122
00:10:22,872 --> 00:10:25,458
Anastasia!
You might be able to help yourself.

123
00:10:25,541 --> 00:10:28,294
It's easy for you to jump on the pavement,

124
00:10:28,377 --> 00:10:31,380
but for now, don't let go of my rope.

125
00:10:31,464 --> 00:10:36,260
Your weight is choking our foe.
The Stand is powerless!

126
00:10:36,344 --> 00:10:40,056
Not only that, it doesn't have
the strength to break free!

127
00:10:42,266 --> 00:10:44,393
Unbelievable!

128
00:10:44,477 --> 00:10:49,190
It's trying to grab Jolyne's string
before it suffocates!

129
00:10:49,899 --> 00:10:52,610
If it grabs Jolyne's rope with its hands…

130
00:10:53,110 --> 00:10:57,073
The thread will turn inside out
and disintegrate!

131
00:10:57,156 --> 00:11:00,242
Jolyne, let go of its neck.

132
00:11:00,326 --> 00:11:03,496
I did this to free you from its grasp!

133
00:11:03,579 --> 00:11:07,083
No, Anastasia. I have to face it now.

134
00:11:07,166 --> 00:11:10,586
Our chance is now,
with the rope around its neck!

135
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:13,381
I'm not trying to strangle it.

136
00:11:13,464 --> 00:11:16,717
I'll close in and finish it off!

137
00:11:17,301 --> 00:11:19,220
What are you saying, Jolyne?

138
00:11:19,303 --> 00:11:21,514
If it grabs a hold of this rope,

139
00:11:21,597 --> 00:11:23,516
it will invert your thread.

140
00:11:23,599 --> 00:11:27,520
Then your arm will get inverted as well!

141
00:11:31,690 --> 00:11:33,442
Damn you!

142
00:11:33,526 --> 00:11:36,612
I'll reach you in no time, just you wait!

143
00:11:38,239 --> 00:11:41,534
No matter what I say, Jolyne won't listen.

144
00:11:41,617 --> 00:11:43,327
We're in a horrible situation.

145
00:11:43,411 --> 00:11:45,329
Fuck it!

146
00:11:45,413 --> 00:11:47,498
If you're finishing it off, then be quick!

147
00:11:47,581 --> 00:11:51,252
Hurry up and break free!

148
00:11:51,335 --> 00:11:54,755
Ah, he grabbed her rope!

149
00:11:57,800 --> 00:12:00,678
No, I still have time.

150
00:12:00,761 --> 00:12:04,432
My thread
will stay intact just a moment longer!

151
00:12:10,229 --> 00:12:11,939
STAND NAME: SEE MOON
STAND MASTER: FATHER PUCCHI

152
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:14,900
This is Sigma Team.

153
00:12:14,984 --> 00:12:17,403
It's no good, we can't go any further.

154
00:12:17,486 --> 00:12:19,113
The tank flipped over!

155
00:12:19,196 --> 00:12:22,283
Get any closer to the Visitor Center,

156
00:12:22,366 --> 00:12:23,909
and the tank flips upside down!

157
00:12:23,993 --> 00:12:26,787
What do you mean, "the tank flips?"

158
00:12:26,871 --> 00:12:28,706
Report!

159
00:12:28,789 --> 00:12:30,082
It's just as I said.

160
00:12:30,166 --> 00:12:31,375
The tank flips over!

161
00:12:31,459 --> 00:12:34,253
Some force is flipping the tank over.

162
00:12:34,336 --> 00:12:36,088
We can't figure it out.

163
00:12:36,172 --> 00:12:38,757
Please send scientists or experts
to investigate.

164
00:12:39,341 --> 00:12:41,010
Don't try to figure it out.

165
00:12:41,093 --> 00:12:44,096
Our mission is to rescue the victims!

166
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:48,809
Still, we really have no idea
what's going on.

167
00:12:49,393 --> 00:12:53,439
We don't know if there are survivors,
or how big the affected area is.

168
00:12:53,522 --> 00:12:55,316
The entire place is a mess.

169
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:57,610
What is going on?

170
00:12:58,110 --> 00:13:01,989
It's as if a hammer fell from the sky
and pounded onto the ground,

171
00:13:02,072 --> 00:13:04,241
and turned the area into a scrapyard!

172
00:13:07,953 --> 00:13:09,246
This is J-Hawk 9.

173
00:13:09,914 --> 00:13:12,666
I have vision on the center.
It's three kilometers away.

174
00:13:13,167 --> 00:13:15,336
Attempting to locate the survivors.

175
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:19,256
What the hell?

176
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:20,799
Which way is up?

177
00:13:21,926 --> 00:13:23,761
Mayday!

178
00:13:29,308 --> 00:13:30,309
J-Hawk 9?

179
00:13:30,392 --> 00:13:31,685
J-Hawk 9!

180
00:13:31,769 --> 00:13:33,354
What happened? Do you copy?

181
00:13:34,146 --> 00:13:36,482
J-Hawk 6, do you copy?

182
00:13:41,153 --> 00:13:45,574
This is our opportunity
to defeat the priest's Stand!

183
00:13:45,658 --> 00:13:49,036
But this is too risky!

184
00:13:49,119 --> 00:13:52,498
Jolyne's arm is getting shredded!

185
00:13:52,581 --> 00:13:54,917
Don't waste your time!

186
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:57,878
Hurry up and finish it off!

187
00:14:00,339 --> 00:14:02,800
Stone Ocean!

188
00:14:11,433 --> 00:14:16,480
It's inverting the steel plating
to stand itself up!

189
00:14:16,564 --> 00:14:19,900
Hurry! Hurry up and finish it!

190
00:14:19,984 --> 00:14:22,194
This is hopeless,
it's almost all the way up!

191
00:14:25,072 --> 00:14:27,491
It ripped more tiles off!

192
00:14:32,496 --> 00:14:33,998
It grabbed her string!

193
00:14:34,582 --> 00:14:37,459
Jolyne, let go of it!

194
00:14:37,543 --> 00:14:41,839
You have to run!
Your arm will get shredded!

195
00:14:43,424 --> 00:14:44,925
Diver Drive!

196
00:14:50,556 --> 00:14:54,351
I submerged Diver Drive into the rope.

197
00:14:55,185 --> 00:14:59,189
And now, instead of Jolyne's rope,

198
00:14:59,273 --> 00:15:01,984
my body will turn inside out!

199
00:15:02,568 --> 00:15:03,652
Anastasia.

200
00:15:05,696 --> 00:15:10,367
Get it, Jolyne. As long as your string
is wrapped around its neck,

201
00:15:10,451 --> 00:15:14,038
I won't let it get up!

202
00:15:14,121 --> 00:15:18,292
- Anastasia!
- Now go! End this fight, Jolyne!

203
00:15:27,968 --> 00:15:32,556
After all, it was in my best interest
to get rid of you when I had the chance.

204
00:15:33,682 --> 00:15:36,602
When you were in prison,
at the very beginning.

205
00:15:37,770 --> 00:15:42,107
Jesus bore the fate of being crucified.

206
00:15:42,191 --> 00:15:46,403
Mary, Mother of Jesus,
was fated to lose her son.

207
00:15:46,904 --> 00:15:51,450
To achieve happiness,
humans must bear a curse,

208
00:15:51,533 --> 00:15:53,077
and overcome fate.

209
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:59,041
The trial Dio and I had to overcome
was Joestar's bloodline.

210
00:15:59,124 --> 00:16:00,751
This can't be…

211
00:16:00,834 --> 00:16:03,337
The priest is here!

212
00:16:03,921 --> 00:16:07,925
I have come to save my Stand,
which is still undergoing evolution.

213
00:16:26,986 --> 00:16:28,737
What?

214
00:16:28,821 --> 00:16:32,449
My body is rising towards the sky!

215
00:16:33,033 --> 00:16:35,202
I am the center of gravity.

216
00:16:36,203 --> 00:16:40,082
Gravity is reversed wherever I stand.

217
00:16:40,666 --> 00:16:43,252
The closer you come to me,
the stronger the gravity gets.

218
00:16:43,752 --> 00:16:47,381
The last step is to bide my time
until my ability fully evolves.

219
00:16:47,464 --> 00:16:50,175
It will harness even greater power,

220
00:16:50,259 --> 00:16:52,136
not the little strength it has now.

221
00:16:53,053 --> 00:16:55,889
Anastasia, pull on her rope!

222
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:57,891
I'm trying already!

223
00:17:00,394 --> 00:17:02,396
Listen closely, my Stand.

224
00:17:02,479 --> 00:17:06,316
I'll say this again. Invert her only once.

225
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:09,236
Do not strike more than once.

226
00:17:09,319 --> 00:17:11,321
The attack to a vital area
is more devastating

227
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:13,073
than one to the arms or body.

228
00:17:13,782 --> 00:17:17,536
Remember, a single punch will do.

229
00:17:30,883 --> 00:17:35,596
Splendid.
We shall return to the Visitor Center.

230
00:17:47,191 --> 00:17:49,234
What?

231
00:17:49,318 --> 00:17:51,153
The fight is over.

232
00:17:51,737 --> 00:17:55,991
Jolyne can no longer feel pain
or even think.

233
00:17:56,075 --> 00:17:59,078
Her heart was turned inside out,

234
00:17:59,161 --> 00:18:02,581
reversing the blood flow to her brain.

235
00:18:03,165 --> 00:18:04,541
Anastasia, pull her close!

236
00:18:04,625 --> 00:18:08,253
Hurry, draw her in!

237
00:18:11,507 --> 00:18:13,592
Jolyne's strings…

238
00:18:24,144 --> 00:18:25,062
No…

239
00:18:26,897 --> 00:18:29,316
This can't be happening!

240
00:18:34,196 --> 00:18:37,116
Jolyne!

241
00:18:41,787 --> 00:18:43,372
This ability,

242
00:18:43,455 --> 00:18:45,791
I shall name it See Moon.

243
00:18:47,167 --> 00:18:48,502
Invincibility.

244
00:18:50,087 --> 00:18:54,550
Did I gain invincibility
before the new moon?

245
00:18:56,760 --> 00:19:00,848
However, my ultimate goal
does not lie in simply achieving strength.

246
00:19:00,931 --> 00:19:07,271
I shall remind myself that my pursuit
is the happiness of all human beings.

247
00:19:07,354 --> 00:19:11,358
Jolyne Cujoh is no more than a casualty,

248
00:19:12,276 --> 00:19:15,320
just like Weather and the prisoners
whose lives were sacrificed.

249
00:19:15,404 --> 00:19:18,991
To successfully achieve a goal,

250
00:19:19,074 --> 00:19:21,201
trial and sacrifice is inevitable.

251
00:19:21,285 --> 00:19:23,453
I don't believe this.

252
00:19:23,537 --> 00:19:27,082
What should I do, Jolyne?

253
00:19:28,167 --> 00:19:29,084
What happened just now…

254
00:19:31,128 --> 00:19:33,547
No, this can't be happening!

255
00:19:49,354 --> 00:19:50,230
What's that?

256
00:19:51,356 --> 00:19:52,733
Where is that sound coming from?

257
00:19:54,276 --> 00:19:57,154
It's the phone!

258
00:19:57,738 --> 00:19:59,239
It didn't have a signal a moment ago.

259
00:20:00,574 --> 00:20:02,117
I got a new message.

260
00:20:03,327 --> 00:20:04,703
Who is it from?

261
00:20:06,872 --> 00:20:08,332
My calls aren't going through.

262
00:20:09,124 --> 00:20:13,795
The gravitational anomaly seems to
have sent a satellite out of orbit.

263
00:20:14,379 --> 00:20:15,797
Are you Emporio?

264
00:20:16,381 --> 00:20:18,091
I don't know exactly what's going on,

265
00:20:18,675 --> 00:20:21,845
but I can sense that my daughter
and the priest have met.

266
00:20:22,346 --> 00:20:24,973
Could this be…

267
00:20:25,933 --> 00:20:27,100
Is this him?

268
00:20:27,726 --> 00:20:29,311
Is this message from…

269
00:20:30,562 --> 00:20:32,064
Jolyne is alive.

270
00:20:32,147 --> 00:20:35,359
But she's not safe.

271
00:20:35,859 --> 00:20:37,361
Protect Jolyne.

272
00:20:37,861 --> 00:20:39,988
Just until I arrive… that's all I ask.

273
00:20:40,572 --> 00:20:44,493
She must have discovered how to
counter his gravity.

274
00:20:44,576 --> 00:20:46,245
That's the only way
she could have survived.

275
00:20:46,828 --> 00:20:48,664
She's alive, but just barely.

276
00:20:49,748 --> 00:20:50,832
Jotaro Kujo.

277
00:20:51,583 --> 00:20:53,669
It's Mr. Jotaro!

278
00:20:53,752 --> 00:20:55,087
He's nearby!

279
00:20:56,088 --> 00:20:58,006
I don't believe this.

280
00:20:58,507 --> 00:21:00,384
Jolyne is alive!

281
00:21:01,843 --> 00:21:03,512
That means…

282
00:21:04,888 --> 00:21:05,889
No, this can't be!

283
00:21:06,556 --> 00:21:08,892
Anastasia, find Jolyne!

284
00:21:09,393 --> 00:21:11,979
Jolyne isn't dead!

285
00:21:12,062 --> 00:21:13,188
What?

286
00:21:13,272 --> 00:21:16,566
But the priest knows too,

287
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:21,488
because he must've sensed
that she's alive!

288
00:21:21,571 --> 00:21:24,658
What did you do, Jolyne Cujoh?

289
00:21:24,741 --> 00:21:27,077
Your heart was turned inside out!

290
00:21:27,911 --> 00:21:31,206
Gravity imploded your heart!

291
00:21:32,082 --> 00:21:34,501
How could she still be alive?

292
00:21:34,584 --> 00:21:35,919
How did she manage to survive?

293
00:21:36,503 --> 00:21:38,338
We must settle the score.

294
00:21:38,422 --> 00:21:41,883
The Joestar bloodline must be overcome!

295
00:21:41,967 --> 00:21:43,635
Diver Drive!

296
00:21:51,101 --> 00:21:53,562
Where are you going?

297
00:21:54,604 --> 00:21:55,939
Isn't it obvious?

298
00:21:56,565 --> 00:22:00,902
The best way to protect Jolyne
is to kill that priest!

299
00:22:02,779 --> 00:22:08,952
MARCH 21ST, 2012 11:44 AM

300
00:22:09,036 --> 00:22:14,124
36 HOURS AND 16 MINUTES UNTIL THE NEW MOON

301
00:23:41,336 --> 00:23:46,341
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
